cts, and manipulating the environment in order to overcome the puzzle-like obstacles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067260/extras/0fd7a7b497baa1d176d281a4770e79e9.poster.avif?t=1683214215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067260/extras/0fd7a7b497baa1d176d281a4770e79e9.webm?t=1683214215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067260/extras/0fd7a7b497baa1d176d281a4770e79e9.mp4?t=1683214215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fear of the Dark</h2>  Your fear gives you away... You mustn\u2019t linger in the dark for too long as it increases your fear level, making it much easier for the parasite to find you. Keep to the light and keep your light source closer to you if you want to make it out of the hospital in one piece.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067260/extras/71ca000ae2bdd504777a54bd705729f8.poster.avif?t=1683214215\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067260/extras/71ca000ae2bdd504777a54bd705729f8.webm?t=1683214215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067260/extras/71ca000ae2bdd504777a54bd705729f8.mp4?t=1683214215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
